umask - display or change the creation mask

SYNOPSIS
    umask [octal-mask]

DESCRIPTION
    Without a value, print the current mask. Clear masked bits when
    creating files or directories. A child inherits its parent's mask.
    This command is a shell built-in.

EXAMPLES
    umask 077

SEE ALSO
    chmod(1), sh(1)
